# Documentation — not needed for runtime, EXCEPT the AI Knowledge Base: it is compiled
# into Wesal.Infrastructure as embedded resources (see Wesal.Infrastructure.csproj), so it
# must be part of the build context or production silently ships with zero articles.
documentation/*
!documentation/ai-knowledge
